                "textId": "Performance_1106301_1083305890_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "艾莎莎尼说煮茶太慢，\n等不及可以把所有东西都丢进榨汁机，\n{A挠头}“嗞——”地一声打成、咳！也是其中一种。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1106301_1083305890_content",
                "value": "艾莎莎尼说煮茶太慢，\n等不及可以把所有东西都丢进榨汁机，\n{A挠头}“嗞——”地一声打成、咳！也是其中一种。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
